ZCL_COMMAND_READY_READ(
    "fleet.mission.board", "fleet.mission", "",
    "Kanban of fleet work: backlog, claimed, building, review, proving, "
    "landed, failed",
    "Projects the dev agent queue (BACKLOG queued, BUILDING running), the "
    "steer outbox (CLAIMED bodies starting CLAIM, deduplicated by sender and "
    "ref; REVIEW bodies starting READY; both within hours) and the dev land "
    "queue (PROVING queued or inflight; LANDED and FAILED within hours, "
    "FAILED with its dimension) into seven columns. hours is 1..168, default "
    "24; limit is 1..32 cards per column, default 12, and a column over its "
    "limit reports the overflow count. Each card is one line of at most 46 "
    "characters. Holds no state of its own and is read-only: it creates no "
    "file, takes no queue or step lock and never advances a mail cursor; the "
    "steer outbox is read only from its last 2 MiB and last 4096 rows, and "
    "when it is absent CLAIMED and REVIEW show one card, steer bus not on "
    "this host. A malformed row is skipped and counted in skipped. Output is "
    "columns, counts and a box-drawn screen at most 120 columns wide. It "
    "contacts no peer and never waits.", 65536,
    "fleet,mission,board,kanban,backlog,claimed,building,review,proving,landed,failed,queue,land,steer",
    "zcl.fleet_mission_board.input.v1", "zcl.fleet_mission_board.v1",
